WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:17.944
Meeting someone is surely

00:17.944 --> 00:21.114
The dawn within our hearts

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
And a new breeze is born from there

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Once you've realized you're not alone

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
The translucent Moon will smile

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Then, the prelude you can hear in your spirit

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Is a nostalgic but unusual song

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Surely

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Everyone is born so that they can meet someone

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, out into the boundless world...

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Yes, so we may search for love

01:36.424 --> 01:39.694
Tatsuya, we'll soon be entering
the kingdom's airspace.

01:39.864 --> 01:41.194
O-okay.

01:43.834 --> 01:46.394
And here comes our "greeting".

01:55.014 --> 01:59.184
Unknown vessel, you have entered
Sphere Kingdom airspace.

01:59.184 --> 02:00.244
Halt immediately.

02:00.954 --> 02:04.024
Dammit! And we were almost to the Moon...

02:04.024 --> 02:05.284
Tatsuya?

02:05.284 --> 02:06.254
Yes?

02:06.254 --> 02:08.054
Please hold on tightly.

02:08.324 --> 02:09.184
Huh?

02:15.394 --> 02:19.564
It's so fast! Ah, Control!

02:22.774 --> 02:26.444
This vessel has been customized
for my personal use.

02:26.444 --> 02:28.464
Normal vessels won't be able to keep up.

02:28.974 --> 02:31.204
Now then, please look directly forward.

02:35.254 --> 02:36.214
- Episode 11-
That Hand Placed Atop
the Princess's

02:36.214 --> 02:39.054
- Episode 11-
That Hand Placed Atop
the Princess's
That Hand Placed Atop
the Princess's

02:39.054 --> 02:41.214
- Episode 11-
That Hand Placed Atop
the Princess's

02:59.444 --> 03:00.874
What do you think?

03:01.514 --> 03:05.084
Your first look at the Moon from up close...

03:05.084 --> 03:09.574
It's spectacular. This is where
you and Feena were born.

03:11.024 --> 03:15.524
Seen from the Earth, the Moon looks kind,
almost nostalgic...

03:15.524 --> 03:20.824
But up close, it's so cold somehow.
That's how it feels.

03:21.694 --> 03:24.434
I'm sorry! That was rude.

03:24.434 --> 03:27.734
Miss Sefiria said the same thing.

03:28.874 --> 03:32.674
"The coldness of men's hearts
comes forth in their world.

03:32.674 --> 03:37.444
"It is that which rejects the Earth,
the people of the Moon themselves."

03:39.444 --> 03:42.754
It is the same with the Earth as well.

03:42.754 --> 03:45.524
The first time I visited the Earth,

03:45.524 --> 03:48.684
I felt such fear that I thought
it would swallow me whole.

03:49.324 --> 03:51.894
But you don't anymore, right?

03:51.894 --> 03:57.624
No. Thanks to Miss Sefiria, Sayaka,
and you and Miss Feena.

03:57.804 --> 04:01.334
Yeah. The Moon and the Earth
can come together for sure.

04:01.334 --> 04:03.824
And we'll help them do it!

04:05.104 --> 04:08.844
If the wise princess who chose you
can become our leader,

04:08.844 --> 04:12.284
then this recklessness of mine
will have been worth it.

04:13.144 --> 04:16.214
The truly reckless part is yet to come.

04:16.214 --> 04:17.014
Okay!

04:18.324 --> 04:22.624
"Regarding the protest previously
submitted to the Earth government

04:22.754 --> 04:25.224
"under the name of Sir Jurgen,
Captain of the royal guard,

04:25.364 --> 04:29.494
"a thorough investigation will be required
to arrive at a genuine solution,

04:29.634 --> 04:32.764
"for which we would ask the requisite
amount of time," was their reply.

04:33.404 --> 04:36.804
I would like to hear what everyone
has to say regarding this.

04:36.804 --> 04:40.944
They want time? The crimes the Earth
has committed are clear.

04:40.944 --> 04:42.474
There is only one "genuine"
act they can perform,

04:42.474 --> 04:44.774
and that is to issue an immediate apology!

04:44.984 --> 04:48.314
No, a thorough investigation
is certainly necessary.

04:48.314 --> 04:51.454
If an error is made in handling an incident
that also regards Miss Feena,

04:51.454 --> 04:54.784
it could have a dramatic effect
on public sentiment.

04:55.324 --> 04:57.024
You speak the truth.

04:57.024 --> 05:01.294
And as the princess's fiancé, I do not
wish her to suffer undue blame.

05:01.964 --> 05:03.164
Sir Jurgen!

05:03.164 --> 05:06.264
Such profound love he has for our princess!

05:06.264 --> 05:12.644
However, if we are too lenient,
we risk giving the Earth the advantage.

05:12.644 --> 05:15.814
Thus, what say we present them
with a condition?

05:15.814 --> 05:17.314
What condition?

05:17.314 --> 05:18.514
For the time being,

05:18.514 --> 05:23.284
ships going between our two worlds will be
subject to somewhat stricter regulations.

05:23.854 --> 05:28.124
Establishing dealings with the Earth has been
the fervent wish of our future queen

05:28.124 --> 05:31.024
but it is clear that progress on this has stalled.

05:31.364 --> 05:34.994
Rather than spending taxpayer money,

05:34.994 --> 05:40.004
is it not better to find another way such as this to
effectively increase revenue, Adjutant General?

05:40.004 --> 05:42.804
Our military forces are fully prepared.

05:42.804 --> 05:45.634
Just what is it you plan on attacking?

05:45.774 --> 05:50.284
That, of course would be those savages,
who could bare their fangs at any time.

05:50.284 --> 05:51.874
Do not be so presumptuous, Jurgen!

05:52.884 --> 05:54.374
My apologies.

05:54.854 --> 05:55.884
I bring news!

05:55.884 --> 05:58.144
What do you want?! We are in council!

05:59.724 --> 06:03.654
I'm very sorry, sir! We've received
an emergency alert from Control!

06:05.094 --> 06:05.924
Let's hear it.

06:05.924 --> 06:11.634
Earlier, a fighter craft shook off our patrol ships
and entered kingdom airspace.

06:11.634 --> 06:14.154
The pilot was Karen Clavius.

06:14.404 --> 06:15.334
What?!

06:15.334 --> 06:17.894
You're honestly saying it's Karen Clavius?!

06:18.144 --> 06:19.774
But she...

06:19.774 --> 06:21.404
She supposedly fled to Earth.

06:21.644 --> 06:25.284
Madam Clavius is requesting an audience
with you, Your Excellency.

06:25.284 --> 06:27.184
How brazen!

06:27.454 --> 06:31.684
Until this latest incident,
I had held her in highest regard.

06:31.684 --> 06:33.184
Grant her entry.

06:33.184 --> 06:34.884
That will not do!

06:35.224 --> 06:38.884
For her traitorous acts,
she should be shot down at once.

06:38.994 --> 06:41.694
No! These latest suspicions notwithstanding,

06:41.694 --> 06:44.434
Karen has been a loyal subject,
devoted to the kingdom.

06:44.434 --> 06:46.904
She shall not be given an ignominious death!

06:46.904 --> 06:49.904
Then let us threaten her, make her turn back.

06:49.904 --> 06:53.244
Later, depending upon the Earth's response,

06:53.244 --> 06:56.544
any and all parties will have the
opportunity to explain themselves.

06:56.544 --> 06:58.184
Do NOT kill her.

06:58.184 --> 06:59.844
Understood, sir.

07:00.014 --> 07:05.454
I don't know why she returned, but this is the
perfect pretext against the Earth.

07:05.454 --> 07:09.054
Aim often goes astray when
firing warning shots...

07:15.494 --> 07:17.484
It would seem they've come to a decision.

07:18.164 --> 07:19.134
Please hang on.

07:40.024 --> 07:41.814
We won't accomplish anything at this rate.

07:42.354 --> 07:44.194
Perhaps if we destroy the dock...

07:44.194 --> 07:48.664
No! If you do that, you could injure some
of the people down there!

07:48.664 --> 07:49.924
Tatsuya...

07:50.134 --> 07:54.574
I didn't come here to start a war.
I came to help Feena.

07:55.604 --> 08:00.564
Honestly, all of the people I serve
say such unreasonable things...

08:01.014 --> 08:03.774
Still, let us try being unreasonable.

08:23.434 --> 08:25.624
Is that Karen's?

08:28.434 --> 08:30.704
Is Tatsuya with her?

08:32.904 --> 08:35.814
I... I...

08:39.384 --> 08:41.374
Hey, what is that?

08:41.714 --> 08:44.114
That can't be a fight, right?

08:44.354 --> 08:46.824
A fight? With who?

08:47.894 --> 08:51.344
Washing with Moon Soap
makes your skin silky smooth!

08:53.264 --> 08:55.254
Dammit! She dodged them again!

08:55.364 --> 08:57.594
Can't we increase the number of missiles?

08:57.704 --> 08:59.564
Damn traitor...

08:59.564 --> 09:02.504
Have the missiles in Sector B-12 launch as well!

09:02.874 --> 09:04.774
Should we really do that, sir?

09:04.774 --> 09:08.774
There's an Earthling aboard, which could
make this an interplanetary incident.

09:08.774 --> 09:11.444
Aboard that ship are a traitor
and her co-conspirator.

09:11.444 --> 09:13.314
We won't hear any complaints
from Earth about it.

09:13.314 --> 09:16.114
Besides, these orders come from Lord Jurgen.

09:16.554 --> 09:17.984
Lord Jurgen?!

09:18.554 --> 09:21.044
What the?! Hey, confirm those readings!

09:21.124 --> 09:22.124
What is it?

09:22.124 --> 09:25.124
The dock in Block 3 has been opened!

09:25.124 --> 09:27.564
What?! Close it at once!

09:27.564 --> 09:28.324
Sir!

09:29.464 --> 09:30.294
This is...

09:30.294 --> 09:34.134
It's no good, sir! It's not responding
to our controls at all.

09:34.134 --> 09:35.464
What?!

09:41.174 --> 09:42.914
Why'd the dock open?

09:42.914 --> 09:46.144
The Moon isn't full of nothing but enemies.

09:46.384 --> 09:48.154
Get some soldiers down there to the block!

09:48.154 --> 09:51.454
The traitors must not be allowed
to get near the royal palace!

09:51.454 --> 09:52.884
Yes, sir!

09:53.584 --> 09:55.054
What the?

09:55.324 --> 09:57.124
Now what?!

09:57.124 --> 09:58.494
Well, uh...

10:01.064 --> 10:02.324
Tatsuya.

10:02.834 --> 10:05.564
There's no way of knowing what awaits us.

10:05.564 --> 10:08.164
If it comes to it, protect yourself with this.

10:08.474 --> 10:09.334
But...

10:09.334 --> 10:12.374
It's all right. It's a police-issue stun blade.

10:12.374 --> 10:15.404
It renders people unconscious,
but it is non-lethal.

10:15.874 --> 10:17.244
Okay.

10:19.984 --> 10:21.554
There they are! Down here!

10:21.554 --> 10:22.914
This way! Quickly!

10:22.914 --> 10:23.784
Okay!

10:24.284 --> 10:25.654
Wait!

10:25.884 --> 10:28.154
The intruders are heading toward the No. 3 exit!

10:28.254 --> 10:30.394
Head around the other way
and we'll surround them.

10:30.394 --> 10:31.294
Yes, sir!

10:31.294 --> 10:32.654
Hurry!

10:33.894 --> 10:36.594
The traitor and the Earthling are inside the city!

10:36.594 --> 10:39.504
What's more, they could be
in hiding somewhere?!

10:39.504 --> 10:40.804
Silence!

10:40.804 --> 10:43.404
Compose yourselves, and remember
that you are the Aristocracy!

10:43.404 --> 10:46.644
It would seem, however, that the people
have been affected by this as well.

10:46.644 --> 10:49.244
It's only natural that they wish to know
what is transpiring,

10:49.244 --> 10:52.184
so perhaps we need to
release some information.

10:52.514 --> 10:54.814
Have Karen and her accomplice
detained unharmed,

10:54.814 --> 10:58.224
and prepare to have the Earthling handed over
to the Federation Government.

10:58.224 --> 11:00.254
We are going to handle this diplomatically.

11:00.254 --> 11:02.154
So as not to worry the people unnecessarily,

11:02.154 --> 11:04.724
tell them only that we are conducting
a military exercise.

11:04.724 --> 11:06.764
I see. That is a good compromise.

11:06.764 --> 11:10.424
Your Excellency, perhaps this is
a golden opportunity.

11:11.064 --> 11:12.434
Meaning what?

11:12.734 --> 11:14.904
To announce everything
regarding Karen Clavius,

11:14.904 --> 11:18.804
from her treachery to her invading our airspace
and forced entry into the city,

11:18.804 --> 11:21.674
to the people of both the Moon and the Earth.

11:23.444 --> 11:26.044
The Earth's crimes are clear,

11:26.044 --> 11:29.544
so let us increase the people's
animosity toward it.

11:29.784 --> 11:33.184
It would be a punishing blow for the Earth.

11:33.554 --> 11:37.054
When the Federation Government faces
pressure by the media and public opinion

11:37.054 --> 11:39.824
they will have no choice
but to concede to our demands.

11:39.824 --> 11:42.794
This is our chance to rise above the Earth.

11:43.394 --> 11:46.894
Both the people and members of the court
would wish for it.

11:48.504 --> 11:49.904
Very well.

11:50.334 --> 11:53.444
Then I shall attend to the apprehension
of the intruders

11:53.444 --> 11:56.534
as well as the official release of information.

11:58.144 --> 11:59.744
You certainly botched this, didn't you?

11:59.744 --> 12:01.584
My apologies, sir.

12:01.584 --> 12:05.284
In any case, I assume you have learned
why the dock opened.

12:05.584 --> 12:07.784
Yes, regarding that...

12:08.654 --> 12:11.294
I see. So that's it?

12:11.294 --> 12:13.924
What shall we do with the intruders
we're currently searching for?

12:13.924 --> 12:16.264
His Excellency says to apprehend them, but...

12:16.794 --> 12:19.424
Sir, this time we'll get them for sure!

12:21.004 --> 12:22.804
So you've made your move, eh?

12:34.484 --> 12:38.124
Your notes sound a little off.
Is everything all right?

12:38.124 --> 12:42.854
It's nothing! I'm fine! Nothing wrong at all!

12:45.594 --> 12:47.764
Hey, it looks like something's
happened on the Moon!

12:47.764 --> 12:49.864
For real?! Let's go see.

12:49.864 --> 12:50.834
Yeah!

12:51.664 --> 12:53.104
And now breaking news.

12:53.104 --> 12:58.144
It's been learned that Karen Clavius,
military attaché of Sphere Kingdom,

12:58.144 --> 13:04.044
had been secretly in exile here on Earth, and has
boarded a fighter craft along with a citizen of Earth,

13:04.044 --> 13:06.544
violating the kingdom's airspace
and even engaging in a firefight.

13:06.544 --> 13:09.784
The current whereabouts of the two remains unknown.

13:09.784 --> 13:12.824
Sphere Kingdom has expressed its concern
to the Federation Government

13:12.824 --> 13:17.884
and stated that depending on the situation,
it cannot rule out force.

13:18.064 --> 13:19.464
No way! No way!

13:19.464 --> 13:21.584
It's okay. It'll be all right.

13:21.894 --> 13:24.384
But they said they're missing...

13:24.864 --> 13:26.634
We have new information.

13:26.634 --> 13:30.304
The Earth citizen who forcefully entered
the kingdom has now been identified.

13:30.304 --> 13:33.704
He is the eldest son of the host family
for Princess Feena in her stay on Earth.

13:37.044 --> 13:39.744
What's going on?! Natsuki! Mai!

13:41.184 --> 13:43.314
What's going on, Jin?!

13:43.314 --> 13:45.424
What's Tatsu doin' on the Moon?!

13:45.424 --> 13:47.444
F-Father!

13:48.224 --> 13:50.494
Let's hear what the President has to say!

13:50.494 --> 13:52.524
Get Secretary Hozuki out here!

13:52.524 --> 13:55.194
Did she cause problems during
Miss Feena's homestay?

13:55.464 --> 13:59.804
I'm very sorry. It looks like I misjudged this.

13:59.804 --> 14:03.934
I thought King Lyones would help keep it quiet...

14:04.034 --> 14:07.374
It seems the hard-line factions
have grown powerful enough

14:07.374 --> 14:09.814
that King Lyones can't control them on his own.

14:09.814 --> 14:11.934
Do you think this could end
in a worst-case scenario?

14:12.084 --> 14:17.784
If those two buckle under pressure from Jurgen,
who hates the Earth, or...

14:18.154 --> 14:24.114
But I still believe in the conviction
Tatsuya and Feena have for the future.

14:24.524 --> 14:28.324
Of course. Because we were betting on them.

14:34.974 --> 14:36.934
Tatsuya and Karen?

14:36.934 --> 14:42.634
This woman opened the dock
without authorization, giving them entry.

14:42.844 --> 14:45.214
Mia... Why?

14:46.184 --> 14:51.954
Miss Feena, please allow me to surrender
those fugitives in your name.

14:51.954 --> 14:55.414
In doing so, I would guarantee their safety.

14:55.824 --> 14:59.314
Of course, no mention shall be made
of your involvement in their crime.

15:00.024 --> 15:02.434
What are you plotting?

15:02.434 --> 15:06.804
I merely wish to spare my future bride
of any sadness.

15:10.774 --> 15:13.464
Do not do it, Princess!

15:14.744 --> 15:15.764
Mia!

15:16.744 --> 15:20.614
Mr. Tatsuya is risking his life for YOUR sake!

15:20.614 --> 15:24.144
If you simply ignore that, how can you call
yourself a princess?!

15:24.384 --> 15:28.524
You made a promise to Tatsuya on Earth!

15:28.524 --> 15:32.484
How can you hesitate any more
than you already have?!

15:32.624 --> 15:38.034
I've known you since we were children,
and the Princess I know isn't this weak!

15:38.164 --> 15:39.654
Woman!

15:41.234 --> 15:42.164
Halt!

15:47.074 --> 15:52.284
Thank you, Mia. I thought
I had prepared myself, but I...

15:52.284 --> 15:55.354
It seems I need you and Karen...

15:55.354 --> 15:57.454
And I need Tatsuya.

15:57.454 --> 15:58.924
Madam Princess...

16:00.924 --> 16:05.024
I, too, shall bear the burden of
Karen and Tatsuya's crime.

16:05.024 --> 16:09.224
Furthermore, I shall inform my father
of my thoughts regarding this matter...

16:09.794 --> 16:11.534
Together with Tatsuya.

16:11.534 --> 16:13.734
No, Miss Feena.

16:13.734 --> 16:16.674
You shall make yourself comfortable
in your room for the moment.

16:16.974 --> 16:19.874
That statement oversteps the boundaries
of a royal subject.

16:19.874 --> 16:23.204
In any case, your father shall not
be informed of this.

16:23.474 --> 16:28.174
In time, you too will see that
what I am doing is correct.

16:29.514 --> 16:32.954
The Moon and the Earth
could never peacefully coexist.

16:33.424 --> 16:36.444
No. I believe in my father.

16:43.234 --> 16:46.934
The door has been locked. What do we do now?

16:46.934 --> 16:50.394
Mr. Takano, how long do you
intend to stay there?

16:51.544 --> 16:53.664
So, you busted me, huh?

16:53.904 --> 16:54.874
Hya!

16:57.114 --> 16:59.714
Those were some great lines earlier, Mia.

16:59.714 --> 17:03.854
Oh no, I just... Wait, why are you here?

17:03.854 --> 17:06.284
He stowed away and came here along with us.

17:06.284 --> 17:08.424
Well then, if you'd care to help us...

17:08.424 --> 17:13.364
If you don't do somethin' yourself, Mia,
the documentary is worthless!

17:13.864 --> 17:17.594
Mr. Takano, Tatsuya and I
are going to see my father.

17:17.594 --> 17:19.594
For the sake of peace between
the Moon and the Earth!

17:20.604 --> 17:21.674
Staff!

17:21.674 --> 17:22.904
Yes, Boss!

17:22.904 --> 17:24.134
Okay!

17:26.974 --> 17:28.774
Now then, slice it open...

17:28.774 --> 17:32.234
Princess of Sphere Kingdom,
Feena Fam Earthlight!

17:37.684 --> 17:39.414
I'm coming, Tatsuya.

17:41.754 --> 17:45.284
That little brat. Try to be nice
and she gets all cocky!

17:45.424 --> 17:47.724
If she interferes again...

17:49.134 --> 17:54.004
...their childish little pipe dream
will be crushed by my hand!

17:54.004 --> 17:57.104
This way! You search over there! Hurry!

17:57.104 --> 18:00.174
This is as far as we can go without being seen.

18:00.174 --> 18:01.574
Where's Feena?

18:01.574 --> 18:05.104
She could be in her chambers. This way.

18:09.484 --> 18:11.074
We've found you, you damn Earthling!

18:33.004 --> 18:34.164
Get her!

18:43.084 --> 18:44.914
I-incredible...

18:45.684 --> 18:47.184
So this is where you are!

18:47.184 --> 18:48.014
Tatsuya!

18:48.194 --> 18:49.484
Die!

19:01.134 --> 19:02.674
I'm sorry!

19:02.674 --> 19:03.794
Excellently done.

19:04.104 --> 19:05.644
Now then, let's go.

19:05.644 --> 19:06.604
Okay!

19:10.444 --> 19:14.544
The area ahead is one we cannot enter.

19:14.684 --> 19:19.254
The madness and resentment of the past can
only be faced by those who live in the present,

19:19.254 --> 19:21.654
moving to forge a path toward the future!

19:22.494 --> 19:24.454
Tatsuya... Feena...

19:25.424 --> 19:26.864
Good luck.

19:27.264 --> 19:29.994
Let's hurry! I fear what Jurgen has planned!

19:30.364 --> 19:33.334
At a time like this, how 'bout we put
honesty first and foremost?

19:33.334 --> 19:34.264
Very well.

19:34.264 --> 19:35.824
I want to see Tatsuya!

19:36.404 --> 19:38.504
You want to launch the fleet?

19:38.504 --> 19:43.614
Since the reign of Queen Sefiria,
we have conceded to the Earth far too often.

19:43.614 --> 19:47.574
Now is the time we must show them
our true power!

19:52.324 --> 19:54.344
We'll arrive there shortly, Tatsuya.

19:54.594 --> 19:56.854
Feena! I can see you soon!

19:59.364 --> 20:04.794
But only to show them our resolve.
We will not fight them, correct?

20:05.364 --> 20:06.524
Of course.

20:07.664 --> 20:09.294
The Moon has moved into action!

20:09.634 --> 20:12.304
Their space fleet is lining up along the border.

20:12.304 --> 20:16.434
Send a message to the entire fleet.
No one on our side is to open fire, period!

20:20.284 --> 20:21.614
Feena!

20:22.084 --> 20:22.914
Tatsuya!

20:28.624 --> 20:32.924
I've thought a lot on the way here.
About you, coming to the Moon on your own.

20:33.324 --> 20:37.894
Whether I should be angry
or shocked or cry. But...

20:38.664 --> 20:40.064
I finally got to see you!

20:42.374 --> 20:43.864
Tatsuya...

20:44.374 --> 20:45.734
Tatsuya!

20:57.384 --> 21:03.224
An Earth fleet has been deployed directly in front
of the lunar fleet approaching Terran space.

21:03.224 --> 21:05.454
Is it gonna be war after all?!

21:06.464 --> 21:07.684
Brother...

21:08.494 --> 21:11.694
Tatsuya... Feena... Do something!

21:26.184 --> 21:28.974
Is it really going to start again?

21:29.284 --> 21:31.514
The Oedipus War...

21:32.124 --> 21:33.954
Things've gotten as bad as they can get.

21:33.954 --> 21:36.924
I can say now that everythin' depends on you.

21:37.724 --> 21:39.894
Don't leave my side, Tatsuya.

21:39.894 --> 21:40.914
Same here.

21:41.234 --> 21:43.664
I have you.

21:43.664 --> 21:45.164
And I have you.

21:45.164 --> 21:46.934
Go, you two!

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
That platinum-colored crescent moon

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Stands still now, gently

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
I look up at the sky and think

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
That falling star is surely the Moon's tears

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
And I thought of you

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Why do I cry these tears?

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Though all I am doing is praying for eternity...

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
I want to walk with you, believing in the future

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
No matter how many times
the Moon waxes and wanes

23:25.164 --> 23:26.104
Preview

23:26.104 --> 23:28.434
Preview
I love the Earth on which I met you.

23:28.434 --> 23:28.674
Preview
I love the Moon on which you were raised.

23:28.674 --> 23:30.334
I love the Moon on which you were raised.

23:30.334 --> 23:32.374
I love you, born on the Earth.

23:32.374 --> 23:34.204
I love you, born on the Moon.

23:34.204 --> 23:36.544
Even if born on different worlds...

23:36.544 --> 23:36.674
People can learn to love one another.

23:36.674 --> 23:38.884
- Final Episode-
The Princess and...
People can learn to love one another.

23:38.884 --> 23:40.144
- Final Episode-
The Princess and...
